- **The engineering effort is DIAN-NE; the operational risk is not.** FONDOS-CESANTIAS needs zero integration work but carries an uncapped one-day's-salary-per-day-per-employee penalty on a manual annual deadline. I've called that out in INTERLINKAGES §5 so a reader doesn't conflate the two.
